{% comment %}
题语 tiyu：扉页上题的一段话。文武边栏框住全页；引语在框内右半页，宋体 400、sub 档，宽 13 字，两端对齐；人名用楷书竖排在左上（单处不超过 16 字），头上一道 2px 朱线像落款前的一笔，身份横排小字在人名下。左半页留纸。
朱色：人名上的短朱线。楷书：人名一处。入场：引语洇出，人名自上而下，身份最后。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-7);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    text-spacing-trim: trim-both;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  p, h1, h2, ol, ul, li, figure, figcaption, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  p, li, blockquote { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; }
  .frame {
    position: absolute;
    inset: var(--ds-space-5);
    border: 3px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .frame::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: var(--ds-space-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule);
  }
  .quote {
    position: absolute;
    right: var(--ds-space-9);
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    max-width: 13.2em;
    font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-sub);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    line-height: 1.8;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .sign {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--ds-space-9);
    top: var(--ds-space-9);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--ds-space-4);
  }
  .name {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: upright;
    font-family: var(--ds-font-kai);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-head);
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .role {
    max-width: 10em;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-caption);
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-3);
  }
  .name { padding-top: var(--ds-space-3); border-top: 2px solid var(--ds-color-zhu); }
  .role:has(> :empty) { display: none; }
</style>
<div class="frame"></div>
<blockquote class="quote" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-order="1">{{ slots.quote }}</blockquote>
<div class="sign">
  <p class="name" data-ds-enter="fall" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="2">{{ slots.by }}</p>
  <p class="role" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="3">{{ slots.role }}</p>
</div>
